| 250K | 2.20 (asym var) | 2.04–2.29 (p95 3.19) | 11.27 (asym var) | 10.93–11.60 (p95 11.85) | **5.13x** | 19.03 | 9.424625e-11 | WIN | 52.16ms |
| 1M | 5.54 | 4.58–5.80 (p95 6.49) | 28.12 | 27.67–30.27 (p95 32.87) | **5.08x** | 13.64 | 1.133585e-9 | WIN | 108.12ms |

